<p class="whitespace-normal">These keys are not on the form on purpose: changing them moves the plugin away from Synology's own values or exists for the tests. They are honoured when added by hand to <code>synology-hardware.cfg</code> (the parser checks each value: ranges in <code>synohw_cfg_ok</code>, <code>scripts/synohw-lib.sh</code>), and an Apply from this page keeps them (<code>update.php:82</code>, <code>:102-103</code>). The table above the defaults shows what the running daemon actually uses (<code>/var/run/synology-hardware/effective</code>, written at its start).</p>

<div class="title"><span class="left"><i class="title fa fa-question-circle"></i>_(Why only these, and where the facts come from)_</span></div>

